{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-morn-vvre-43yn-cvrx","published":"2026-11-21T08:05:52Z","modified":"2026-11-21T08:15:08.678648082Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-110678"],"summary":"Cpanel::JSON::XS versions before 4.80 for Perl allow memory exhaustion by buffering incremental input past max_size in…","details":"Cpanel::JSON::XS versions before 4.80 for Perl allow memory exhaustion by buffering incremental input past max_size in incr_parse.\n\nThe parser appends each chunk to its buffer. In scalar or list context, it compares max_size with how far it has progressed, not with the buffer length. A chunk that starts with a NUL byte stops the parser before it progresses, and a call in void context skips the check, so the buffer grows without limit.\n\nA peer streaming data to an incr_parse consumer can exhaust process memory regardless of max_size.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"perl-cpanel-json-xs","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/perl-cpanel-json-xs"},"versions":["4.41-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-morn-vvre-43yn-cvrx.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-morn-vvre-43yn-cvrx"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-110678"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2026-110678"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://alas.aws.amazon.com/AL2023/ALAS-2026-3352.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110686"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110685"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110684"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110681"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110680"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110678"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110676"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110673"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-110672"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-110678"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-110678"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://people.ubuntu.com/~ubuntu-security/cve/CVE-2026-110678"}],"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"}]}